OL,3,GNEWSANew reading, maths and attendance
OL,4,Atargets to boost school standards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan setting out new national
OL,7,Fbenchmarks for reading and maths
OL,8,Fstandards has been published, a week
OL,9,Fafter international test results showed
OL,10,FWelsh teenagers lagging further behind
OL,11,Ftheir peers across the UK.
OL,13,FThe Welsh government's foundational
OL,14,Fliteracy and numeracy plan also commits
OL,15,Fto improving attendance levels which
OL,16,Fhave still not fully recovered after
OL,17,Fthe pandemic.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
