OL,3,GNEWSANew reading, maths and attendance
OL,4,Atargets to boost school standards
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation Minister Anna Brychan said
OL,7,Fthe Plaid Cymru government had
OL,8,F"inherited an education system that
OL,9,Flacks clarity, coherence and a sure
OL,10,Fsense of direction".
OL,12,FThe Welsh Conservatives challenged the
OL,13,Fgovernment to learn lessons from
OL,14,FEngland and Reform UK's Helen Jenner
OL,15,Fsaid teachers had been let down by
OL,16,Fpoliticians in Wales.
